{"claim_id":"clm_opt_matrix_adafactor_1","claim_type":"method_definition","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"c4588b37efa33e26","limitations":["rank-1 factorization is an approximation of the true second moments","designed for 2D parameters"],"locator":"method","paper_id":"pap_opt_matrix_adafactor","scope":{"algorithm":"adafactor","cost_axis":"memory","parameter_structure":"matrix"},"statement":"Adafactor replaces the full per-parameter second-moment matrix with a rank-1 factorization stored as per-row and per-column moving-average sums, reducing second-moment memory for an n-by-m matrix from O(nm) to O(n+m).","tags":["adafactor","factored_second_moment","memory","sublinear"]}
