{"claim_id":"clm_opt_matrix_psgd_1","claim_type":"method_definition","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"ef7f02301b2a044a","limitations":["online estimate is approximate","requires Hessian-vector products or finite differences"],"locator":"method","paper_id":"pap_opt_matrix_psgd","scope":{"algorithm":"psgd","preconditioner":"newton_like"},"statement":"PSGD estimates a preconditioner online by minimizing a criterion that matches the amplitude of the preconditioned-gradient noise to that of the parameter perturbations, approximating a Newton-like (inverse-Hessian) scaling from Hessian-vector products.","tags":["psgd","preconditioner","newton","hessian_vector_product"]}
