{"claim_id":"clm_scaling_transfer_hernandez_1","claim_type":"predictive","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"daf564f22750c836","limitations":["power-law form documented in the low-data regime","shown for language-to-code transfer"],"locator":"abstract","paper_id":"pap_scaling_transfer_hernandez","scope":{"regime":"low_data","setting":"pretrain_then_finetune","task":"text_to_python"},"statement":"In the low-data fine-tuning regime, the effective data transferred from pretraining follows a power law in the fine-tuning dataset size and the model's parameter count.","tags":["transfer","effective_data","fine_tuning","power_law"]}
