{"claim_id":"clm_posenc_transformer_xl_1","claim_type":"method_definition","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"2f4f4cb60eabc844","limitations":["relative encoding designed jointly with the recurrence mechanism","adds bias parameters"],"locator":"method","paper_id":"pap_posenc_transformer_xl","scope":{"architecture":"decoder_only_transformer","task":"language_modeling"},"statement":"Transformer-XL reparameterizes attention with a relative positional encoding that injects content-based and position-based bias terms, which is required so that hidden states can be reused across segments without positional ambiguity in its segment-level recurrence.","tags":["relative_position","segment_recurrence","state_reuse"]}
