{"claim_id":"clm_posenc_nope_1","claim_type":"negative_result","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"9d8f33025071f54d","limitations":["evaluated on synthetic reasoning tasks, not open-domain LM","small-to-moderate model scale"],"locator":"results","paper_id":"pap_posenc_nope","scope":{"architecture":"decoder_only_transformer","task":"algorithmic_and_math_reasoning"},"statement":"On downstream reasoning and mathematical tasks, the commonly used explicit positional encodings (absolute embeddings, ALiBi, RoPE, and T5 relative bias) are not well suited for length generalization in decoder-only Transformers.","tags":["length_generalization","positional_encoding_comparison","reasoning"]}
