{"claim_id":"clm_dynamics_edge_of_stability_3","claim_type":"negative_result","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"baa057cc594fbb8a","limitations":["challenges theory rather than replacing it","specific to the observed regime"],"locator":"results","paper_id":"pap_dynamics_edge_of_stability","scope":{"contradicts":"classical L-smooth optimization assumptions"},"statement":"This behavior violates the classical descent-lemma requirement that the learning rate stay below 2/sharpness for monotone loss decrease, so smooth-optimization theory does not describe neural-network training in this regime.","tags":["edge_of_stability","optimization_theory","descent_lemma","negative_result"]}
