{"claim_id":"clm_dynamics_neural_tangent_kernel_2","claim_type":"descriptive","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"9c43e5c52b410abd","limitations":["Gaussian-process correspondence is a wide-limit statement","finite-width corrections exist"],"locator":"results","paper_id":"pap_dynamics_neural_tangent_kernel","scope":{"at":"initialization","limit":"width -> infinity"},"statement":"At initialization wide networks behave like Gaussian processes, and as width grows the NTK converges to a fixed deterministic limiting kernel.","tags":["ntk","gaussian_process","initialization","width"]}
