{"claim_id":"clm_r2_data_model_collapse_inevitable_1","claim_type":"causal","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"dbbdcac725a53604","limitations":["Collapse rate depends on synthetic-data fidelity and sampling","Language-model experiments are at modest scale"],"locator":"abstract","paper_id":"pap_r2_data_model_collapse_inevitable","scope":{"loop":"replace real with synthetic each generation","models":["linear_regression","causal_transformers_LM","diffusion","VAE"]},"statement":"Iteratively replacing real training data with each generation's own synthetic outputs causes test error to grow with the number of model-fitting iterations, i.e. model collapse.","tags":["model_collapse","synthetic_data","data_replacement","recursion"]}
