{"claim_id":"clm_r2_ngram_engram_conditional_memory_1","claim_type":"method_definition","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"b5e366634b628cf3","limitations":["separate hash tables per order cause collisions and block latent sharing across orders","adds an external memory table to serve"],"locator":"abstract","paper_id":"pap_r2_ngram_engram_conditional_memory","scope":{"gate":"context_aware_on_value","hash_heads":"K_per_order","lookup":"O(1)_ngram_hash"},"statement":"Engram offloads static token patterns to an external memory addressed by O(1) n-gram hash lookup, using K distinct hash heads per n-gram order and a context-aware gate that filters the retrieved value before it enters the residual stream, framing memory retrieval as a sparsity axis complementary to Mixture-of-Experts.","tags":["hashed_ngram","value_memory","context_gate","sparsity_axis"]}
