{"claim_id":"clm_r2_ngram_why_knn_lm_works_1","claim_type":"mechanistic","extracted_at":"2026-07-19","fingerprint":"08af3e88bedcf00a","limitations":["analysis on standard LM benchmarks","factors are correlational decompositions"],"locator":"abstract","paper_id":"pap_r2_ngram_why_knn_lm_works","scope":{"factors":["ensembled_representation","approximate_search_regularization","knn_softmax_temperature"]},"statement":"kNN-LM gains come from three factors that are not the retrieval itself: it provides an alternative (ensembled) input representation for next-token prediction, approximate (not exact) nearest-neighbor search acts as beneficial regularization, and calibrating the softmax temperature of the kNN distribution is critical.","tags":["knn_lm","mechanism","softmax_temperature","ensembling"]}
